  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Access to Clean Energy and Biofertilizers for Small and Medium Scale Farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims to provide small and medium farmers with patented waste-to-energy technology to turn their waste into clean energy and biofertilizer. Through this investment, the company plans to install 2200 biogas systems in Blantyre and Thyolo Districts by 2025 and expand in all regions of the country with the goal of reducing greenhouse gas emissions, creating job opportunities for and transforming food systems..The company will also install large biogas systems in four Milk Bulking groups to use biogas generated to run generators for Milk Cooling Tanks.</narrative>
  </description>
